sers/BruhfessorX","html_url":"https://github.com/BruhfessorX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-21T04:09:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:09:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Game\n\nStar Wars: Knights of the Old Republic (2003)\n\n### Plan\n\nWorking on the existing attempt rather than starting fresh. The co-op work is the\nGPL-3.0 reone fork **McChaffeeFAF/kotor-coop** (alpha-0.4.0), not upstream\nseedhartha/reone: the fork adds an authoritative-host online co-op layer so two players\ncan run the KotOR 1 campaign together, with guests taking the party's companions.\n\nWhere I am: built it from source (Visual Studio + vcpkg), verified two real clients\nover direct-ip, and wired a 77-gate scripted suite through the engine's console control\nport (join, module load, movement, dialogue, wallet, containers, level-up, combat, area\ntransitions, pause, doors, exit ready-check). QA level reached: `automated`.\n\nI am opening a PR that corrects the directory entry (it currently points at upstream\nreone with an unknown co-op scope) and adds `games/kotor/` with the write-up and working\nnotes. Notes also record two packaging bugs found and fixed in the fork: the package\nshipped a mismatched VC++ runtime (0xC0000005 at startup) and the launcher refused to\nstart without KotOR II.\n\nNot yet covered, and the honest gaps: store, workbench/lab, swoop/turret minigames and\nFree Mode/character generation are not reachable from the control port without a\nscripted merchant/bench or a different session mode. Nobody has finished the campaign in\nco-op, so this is `automated`, not `verified-playthrough`.\n\n### Your repo or branch (optional)\n\nhttps://github.com/McChaffeeFAF/kotor-coop (the fork itself; my PR to this repo is the\ndirectory entry and write-up)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything/issues/100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything/issues/100/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}},"public":true,"created_at":"2026-10-21T04:10:19Z"},{"id":"17775728162","type":"ForkEvent","actor":{"id":139850265,"login":"BruhfessorX","display_login":"BruhfessorX","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139850265?"},"repo":{"id":1422053844,"name":"cranebeaker/coop-anything","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything"},"payload":{"action":"forked","forkee":{"id":1427862158,"node_id":"R_kgDOVRtyjg","name":"coop-anything","full_name":"BruhfessorX/coop-anything","private":false,"owner":{"login":"BruhfessorX","id":139850265,"node_id":"U_kgDOCFXyGQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139850265?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BruhfessorX","html_url":"https://github.com/BruhfessorX","followers_url":"https://