irectory as findings are confirmed. No co-op test has been run yet.\n\n### Your repo or branch (optional)\n\n_No response_","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything/issues/78/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything/issues/78/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comment":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything/issues/comments/6305473030","html_url":"https://github.com/cranebeaker/coop-anything/issues/78#issuecomment-6305473030","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything/issues/78","id":6305473030,"node_id":"IC_kwDOVMLR1M8AAAABd9XiBg","user":{"login":"fiyage5402","id":345397223,"node_id":"U_kgDOFJZX5w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/345397223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402","html_url":"https://github.com/fiyage5402","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T01:09:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T01:09:55Z","body":"Research update: draft PR #98 (branch `game/the-godfather-ii` in the fork) adds `games/the-godfather-ii/README.md` + `NOTES.md`, the directory entry and the playbook tweaks.\n\nWhere it stands: the SE v0.56 DRM-free `1.0.789.0` build now boots in a disposable copy on the owner machine, reaches the main menu, loads the campaign profile and drops straight into the campaign (no Cuba intro); an own-code ASI plugin loads through the SE extender's loader, hooks the engine, and reads the player's world transform at 5 Hz. Display-path causes (exclusive fullscreen impossible on a virtual display, `Window.Fullscreen` default `1`, a NULL `strstr` in the GPU-vendor detector) are documented with addresses.\n\nQA level: none - no automated assertion suite yet, and no co-op gameplay. The open end is the authoritative transform slot of a second character, which a \"player 2\" puppet would have to write.","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything/issues/comments/6305473030/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}},"public":true,"created_at":"2026-10-21T01:09:55Z"},{"id":"17766813040","type":"PullRequestEvent","actor":{"id":345397223,"login":"fiyage5402","display_login":"fiyage5402","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fiyage5402","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/345397223?"},"repo":{"id":1422053844,"name":"cranebeaker/coop-anything","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything"},"payload":{"action":"opened","number":98,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything/pulls/98","id":4944809509,"number":98,"head":{"ref":"game/the-godfather-ii","sha":"f0f549c844b24a70feaac353c80faf75aec28b72","repo":{"id":1427729739,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fiyage5402/coop-anything","name":"coop-anything"}},"base":{"ref":"main","sha":"9e972b6d8e8aa62c53ad933cff3b64ae489e4ee3","repo":{"id":1422053844,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cranebeaker/coop-anything","name":"coop-anything"}}}},"public":true,"cr